### Listar entregas
GET http://localhost:3004/entregas

### Cadastrar entrega
POST http://localhost:3004/entregas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pedido_id": "69135f3c62be9ac0d5f81234",
  "endereco": "Rua das Flores, 100"
}

### Buscar entrega por ID
GET http://localhost:3004/entregas/69135f3c62be9ac0d5f89999

### Buscar entrega por pedido
GET http://localhost:3004/entregas/pedido/69135f3c62be9ac0d5f81234

### Atualizar status da entrega
PUT http://localhost:3004/entregas/69135f3c62be9ac0d5f89999/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "EM_TRANSITO"
}